25	// gitRefsStore is the git-backed persistent checkpoint store that keeps one ref
26	// per checkpoint at refs/entire/checkpoints/<shard>/<id>. Each ref points at a
27	// commit whose tree root IS that checkpoint's contents (metadata.json, 0/, 1/,
28	// tasks/…), so updates advance the ref and preserve per-checkpoint history. It
29	// shares the checkpoint-subtree machinery with the git-branch store via the
30	// embedded *treeWriter (anchored at basePath ""), differing only in where the
31	// subtree is committed: a per-checkpoint ref instead of the v1 branch.
